    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect Mokitons in this city management game, where tamers and their monsters unite in battle, evolve and bond together in their unique town.</strong><br><br><br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/11ba8da595b49b30b8667569ab5eb66d.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/11ba8da595b49b30b8667569ab5eb66d.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/11ba8da595b49b30b8667569ab5eb66d.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><i>Tamer Town</i> is a unique blend of monster collecting and city-building gameplay. It invites you to build more than just a town \u2014 you'll shape an ecosystem where monsters and humans grow, thrive and stand together in competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/5c1e5e80a528907e381e06710e9d7592.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=610 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/5c1e5e80a528907e381e06710e9d7592.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/5c1e5e80a528907e381e06710e9d7592.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise over 130 unique Mokitons, each with distinct personalities, elemental traits and evolution paths. Support strong bonds between tamers and their Mokitons \u2014 it\u2019s the foundation of a thriving city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/439c587674db2d992c6ddad99aba4ca4.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/439c587674db2d992c6ddad99aba4ca4.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/439c587674db2d992c6ddad99aba4ca4.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let Mokitons grow through shared training, work and battles alongside their tamers. Level them up and unlock powerful evolutions through teamwork and care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/25f4a1de0657f4d43a70b77819b1caa9.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=600 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/25f4a1de0657f4d43a70b77819b1caa9.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/25f4a1de0657f4d43a70b77819b1caa9.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push beyond the borders of your city and uncover new biomes, monsters and missions. Complete special objectives to unlock access to unexplored zones.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/8a1b998298c4b6d01fbc927f227a9970.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/8a1b998298c4b6d01fbc927f227a9970.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/8a1b998298c4b6d01fbc927f227a9970.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send expedition teams on missions like exploration, monster discovery or resource gathering. Prepare carefully \u2014 each zone has its own surprises and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/747c65a9c58b1fc7a396e05592affdad.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=610 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/747c65a9c58b1fc7a396e05592affdad.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/747c65a9c58b1fc7a396e05592affdad.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your city's reputation determines who wants to live there \u2014 and strong tamers are essential to your success. Keep Mokitons happy and productive to raise your city's prestige.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/d8609f876e669aa147662eac7af0eeef.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/d8609f876e669aa147662eac7af0eeef.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/d8609f876e669aa147662eac7af0eeef.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a place where tamers and monsters want to live, train and grow. Rise in the League, go on expeditions and make your city famous across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/e53f0e0ad4a265db786dbd01f744c8cc.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/e53f0e0ad4a265db786dbd01f744c8cc.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/e53f0e0ad4a265db786dbd01f744c8cc.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate valuable resources, sell goods and invest profits to grow your city. Assign Mokitons to jobs that match their strengths to optimize each building's output. Earn money to unlock new homes, decorations and territories. Shape your city into a thriving hub.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/f78ded65d908b4122485602ac20c5dd6.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/f78ded65d908b4122485602ac20c5dd6.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/f78ded65d908b4122485602ac20c5dd6.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost your city's performance by keeping your Mokitons satisfied \u2014 they\u2019ll work harder, fight better and power your town\u2019s growth. Build elemental decorations near their homes and craft special treats to meet their needs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/24d236fef999973c743084e254e637ba.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=610 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/24d236fef999973c743084e254e637ba.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/24d236fef999973c743084e254e637ba.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join high-stakes competitions between cities for the Township Tournament Cup. Build your ultimate team and lead them to victory. Assemble a balanced squad of Mokitons that complement each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/f2a1f32aae931efc45e9a8ef06d0fb83.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/f2a1f32aae931efc45e9a8ef06d0fb83.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/f2a1f32aae931efc45e9a8ef06d0fb83.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your battle arena to suit your strategy. Climb the ranks, adjust your team to counter rivals, and prove your dominance. You can control the action yourself \u2014 or let your city's top tamer take the lead in auto-battles.<br>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/6a5cfbbd3a8c2942094fe95a37f061c6.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/6a5cfbbd3a8c2942094fe95a37f061c6.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/6a5cfbbd3a8c2942094fe95a37f061c6.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay on your toes \u2014 mysterious visitors and events can appear in your city at any time.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/010ec4714e910ffe1cfffcdaf3a1eb1b.poster.avif?t=1753801246\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/010ec4714e910ffe1cfffcdaf3a1eb1b.webm?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601860/extras/010ec4714e910ffe1cfffcdaf3a1eb1b.mp4?t=1753801246\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to surprise challengers offering unique rewards and rare Mokitons. Adapt to unpredictable strategies and unusual team compositions that will test your flexibility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in special encounters that push your tactical skills to the limit. Turn every surprise into an opportunity.</p>",
